                <pb facs="1028" n="914" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg914"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.00/690: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Culbertson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-09-06T18:00:00-04:00">September 6, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:19 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>111. Alessandri nominated for the presidency today with almost unanimity by a
                    convention of all the Left parties except the extreme Communists who support
                    Hidalgo. His acceptance would be just another complication.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
